"[[quarkus-narayana-jta_quarkus-transaction-manager-reaper-cancel-fail-wait-period]] [.property-path]##link:#quarkus-narayana-jta_quarkus-transaction-manager-reaper-cancel-fail-wait-period[`+++quarkus.transaction-manager.reaper.cancel-fail-wait-period+++`]##\n"
"config_property_copy_button:+++quarkus.transaction-manager.reaper.cancel-fail-wait-period+++[]\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"[.description]\n"
"--\n"
"The time the reaper waits after interrupting a cancel worker before declaring the transaction a zombie.\n"
"\n"
"After interrupting a cancel worker, the reaper waits this period. If the worker has not completed by then, the transaction is marked as a zombie. In CPU-constrained environments, increasing this value gives the application thread more time to respond to the cancellation.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Environment variable: env_var_with_copy_button:+++QUARKUS_TRANSACTION_MANAGER_REAPER_CANCEL_FAIL_WAIT_PERIOD+++[]\n"
"--"
